# Production env — NON-SECRET config only. TRACKED in git (repo is public; every
# value here is already public). docker-compose.tight.yml reads it via --env-file.
# This file is the SINGLE SOURCE of prod non-secret config: deploy `git reset
# --hard origin/main` makes the live SWAS .env.production match this exactly, so it
# MUST mirror prod's real non-secret values (provider toggles included).
#
# 🔐 SECRETS DO NOT BELONG HERE. Every secret (name matching the SECRET_KEY_RE
# _KEY|_SECRET|_TOKEN|_PASSWORD|HMAC) lives ENCRYPTED in secrets.enc.env (SOPS/age)
# and is injected at runtime via `sops exec-env`. To add/edit a secret run
# `sops edit secrets.enc.env` (see ops/runbook/secrets-sops.md) — NEVER paste a
# real value into this file. check-env-sync Check F fails CI if a secret-named key
# carries a plaintext value here; gitleaks is layer two.
#
# Per ADR-0026 § A-Tight v2 资源复用: mono = drop-in replacement of meta-server.
# domain api.shintongtech.com (企业域名 shintongtech.com 子域;同 SWAS,无备案).

# === Image version ===
# Default `latest` is the fallback only. deploy.yml `export MBW_VERSION=<release
# tag>` at deploy time and compose reads shell env ahead of --env-file, so the
# running tag comes from the export (e.g. server-v0.1.5 → image tag v0.1.5).
MBW_VERSION=latest

# Override for local dry-run with a locally-built image:
#   docker build -t nvy-server:dev -f apps/server/Dockerfile .
# MBW_APP_IMAGE=nvy-server:dev

# === App ===
# pino log level: trace | debug | info | warn | error | fatal (default info)
LOG_LEVEL=info

# CORS allow-list (per apps/server/src/config/app.config.ts).
# Production host (Cloudflare Pages per ADR-0025):
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://app.shintongtech.com,https://no-vain-years-mono.pages.dev

# === DB / Redis (single-node SWAS, docker network resolves) ===
# DB_PASSWORD / REDIS_PASSWORD are SECRETS → secrets.enc.env (not here).
# DATABASE_URL / REDIS_URL are auto-composed in docker-compose.tight.yml app
# environment block from DB_USERNAME + those secrets.
DB_USERNAME=mbw

# === SMS gateway (per apps/server/src/config/sms.config.ts; ADR-0013) ===
# 'mock' | 'aliyun'. Prod runs aliyun (real SMS). The ALIYUN_ACCESS_KEY_ID/SECRET
# secrets live in secrets.enc.env; sign-name / template-code are non-secret here.
SMS_GATEWAY=aliyun
ALIYUN_SMS_SIGN_NAME=上海新瞳光年科技
ALIYUN_SMS_TEMPLATE_CODE=SMS_507390061

# === Aliyun OSS — 头像/背景图/灵感附件/mockup 直传 (per oss.config.ts; ADR-0045; 账号 C) ===
# OSS_ACCESS_KEY_ID/SECRET are SECRETS → secrets.enc.env. region/bucket/public
# base are non-secret. OSS_PUBLIC_BASE_URL = 备案下号 + 绑定 img.shintongtech.com
# 后的内联预览基址 (未设则回退默认域名, 内地 bucket 被强制下载 → web <img> 坏).
# 桶从账号 B 的 mbw-profile-images 迁来 —— 那个账号的 OSS 已欠费停服且不再续费,
# 存量对象全是测试数据故整批弃用, 不做迁移。账号 C 的桶与研报桶 (RESEARCH_OSS_*)
# 是两把权限交集为空的 AK: 这把只能写 4 个图片前缀, 那把只能写 research/。
OSS_REGION=oss-cn-shanghai
OSS_BUCKET=nvy-profile-images
OSS_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://img.shintongtech.com

# === Marketdata vendor (per marketdata.config.ts; 015/016) ===
# 'mock' | 'live'. 生产**必须** live — 否则夜间 @Cron 调度器无 kind 守卫地用 Mock
# 适配器把假数据写进生产 DB(静默污染)。LIXINGER_TOKEN (live 必填) 是 SECRET → SOPS。
MARKETDATA_PROVIDER=live

# Minute-level tick scheduler (017 US7 灰度 flag; schema default 'false'). Prod
# runs realtime tick ON. prod-only key → check-env-sync ENV_SPECIFIC_ALLOWLIST.
MARKETDATA_TICK_ENABLED=true

# === Push (JPush; per jpush.config.ts; 022) ===
# 'mock' | 'jpush'. Prod 暂 mock (不发真推送). 翻真推送: 设 jpush + 把 JPUSH_APP_KEY
# / JPUSH_MASTER_SECRET 填进 secrets.enc.env.
JPUSH_GATEWAY=mock

# === Chat 联网搜索 (IQS 阿里云智能搜索; per iqs.config.ts; 030) ===
# 'mock' | 'aliyun'. Prod runs aliyun (真检索). IQS_API_KEY is a SECRET → SOPS.
IQS_PROVIDER=aliyun

# === code-index grounding client (per codeindex.config.ts; 034) ===
# 'fake' | 'http'. Prod runs http (真接地). CODE_INDEX_URL (WireGuard tunnel
# endpoint) AND CODE_INDEX_SERVICE_TOKEN both live in secrets.enc.env as one
# SOPS-managed wiring unit (CODE_INDEX_URL special-cased in .sops.yaml
# encrypted_regex), injected at runtime via `sops exec-env`.
CODE_INDEX_PROVIDER=http

# === ASR 语音转写 (per apps/server/src/config/asr.config.ts; 035) ===
# 'fake' | 'dashscope'. Prod runs dashscope (真转写; DashScope qwen3-asr-flash
# compatible-mode, 北京区, 账号 A). DASHSCOPE_API_KEY is a SECRET → secrets.enc.env,
# injected at runtime via `sops exec-env`. (2026-06-28 cutover: 035 ship 时 deferred
# 的真接线在此补齐; dev/test 仍默认 fake，见 apps/server/.env.example。)
ASR_PROVIDER=dashscope

# === 富途 shim (per marketdata.config.ts; sellput-viz Phase 1) ===
# 港机 (账号 C) 上 OpenD 的 HTTP 薄壳，77 经 B↔C WireGuard 隧道访问。live 下承担 US 交易
# 日历 L1 (腾讯降 L2)。FUTU_SHIM_URL (隧道端点) 与 FUTU_SHIM_TOKEN 同属一个 SOPS 单元 →
# 两者真值均在 secrets.enc.env (FUTU_SHIM_URL 照 CODE_INDEX_URL 先例在 .sops.yaml
# encrypted_regex 里字面特例化)，运行时经 `sops exec-env` 注入。此处**不放明文值**。

# === 研报归档 OSS (per apps/server/src/config/research-oss.config.ts; 057) ===
# 账号 C 的**私有**桶 (无匿名读, FR-017)，与上面账号 B 的 public-read 图片桶两套凭证、
# 两种 ACL、两种用途，刻意不复用 —— 那把 AK 的 RAM 作用域是 avatar/ + background/，
# 与本桶权限交集为空。本桶的 AK 只具 research/ 前缀的 oss:PutObject，无读 / 列举 / 删除
# (FR-018；Phase 0 已用反例实证：写该前缀之外 → 403 AccessDenied)。
# RESEARCH_OSS_ACCESS_KEY_ID/SECRET 是 SECRET → 真值在 secrets.enc.env，此处不放。
RESEARCH_OSS_REGION=oss-cn-shanghai
RESEARCH_OSS_BUCKET=nvy-research-oss

# === guest 投递通道 token (per apps/server/src/config/guest-upload.config.ts; 057 + 059) ===
# GUEST_UPLOAD_TOKEN 是 SECRET → 真值在 secrets.enc.env，此处**不放明文值**。
# 它是 guest-proxy → mono server 这一段的钥匙，必须与 guest 机 render-env.sh 渲染进
# nginx 的值逐字节一致；不一致的表现是恒 401，而 401 按设计不泄露原因，只能靠对账。
# 059 起同一把覆盖三条 location（研报投递 / 锚待审提交 / 锚直写）——「谁能直写锚」的判据
# 因此只在 guest 机的 nginx 上（$anchor_write_allowed），server 侧无第二道闸。刻意如此，
# 理由与「要加回第二把 token 的门槛」单点在 config 顶部。
